# ip groups: group,family,url[,min_entries[,noratio]]
# family: v4 = keep IPv4 CIDRs, drop IPv6 (the only family implemented)
# url: http(s) upstream | local:<path inside this repo>
# min_entries: optional absolute floor (protects the very first build); replaces the default 100
# noratio: optional, skip ratio checks vs the previous build (small curated lists)
# Output: rules/<group>.mrs (behavior ipcidr). See build.sh "IPCIDR GROUPS".
geoip-for-ru-v4,v4,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Davoyan/mihomo-rule-sets/main/ip-for-ru/lists/ips-for-ru.txt,10000
# White-list IPs: resources that stay reachable while mobile internet runs on
# operator whitelists (Davoyan, updated daily). Replaces legiz wli (30k CIDRs,
# 88% non-Russian incl. 7.0.0.0/8, frozen since 2026-05-17), 2026-09-25.
wl-ru-ip-v4,v4,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Davoyan/xray-routing/main/ips/wl-ru.txt,40,noratio
